{"title":"Straight angle","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A <b>straight angle</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Angle\" title=\"Angle\">angle</a> in which the two sides of the angle lie along a single <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\">line</a>, pointing in opposite directions.  The measure of every straight angle is 180 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Degree_(geometry)\" title=\"Degree (geometry)\"> degrees</a> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2ca003a7da0de4994b4733e203b74ff52d42553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Radian\" title=\"Radian\">radians</a>.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d8f2250fed7b456c1e695a93d86d533b480f93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A, B, I;  A = (-1, 0); B = (1, 0); I = (0, 0);  draw(A--B, Arrows); draw(anglemark(B, I, A, 4));  label(&quot;$180^\\circ$&quot;, I, 4N); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Straight_angle&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">Geometry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Angle\" title=\"Angle\">Angle</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_angle\" title=\"Right angle\">Right angle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Acute_angle\" title=\"Acute angle\">Acute angle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Obtuse_angle\" title=\"Obtuse angle\">Obtuse angle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Reflex_angle\" title=\"Reflex angle\">Reflex angle</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Straight_angle&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018003615\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 23/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 445/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.838      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.838      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4015:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018003615 and revision id 174708. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}